03:30:34,540 --> 03:30:43,500
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Director Legazpi, to please mention for the interest para masagot po nang gusto yung tanong.

3607
03:30:53,600 --> 03:30:57,560
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: Good afternoon, Madam Chair and the esteemed members.

3608
03:30:57,580 --> 03:31:00,180
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes, please introduce yourself, ma'am, before you proceed.

3609
03:31:00,380 --> 03:31:06,080
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: I'm Director Edna Imelda Legazpi of the RID of MIMAROPA.

3610
03:31:06,080 --> 03:31:11,820
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: And at the same time, the Gender and Development Focal Person of the CHED Central Office.

3611
03:31:11,820 --> 03:31:18,080
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: To answer po, Representative Elago's questions,

3612
03:31:18,920 --> 03:31:27,860
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: Number one po, we have ongoing survey about the compliance of the different HEIs in relation to our CMO.

3613
03:31:27,860 --> 03:31:34,660
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: Number one, series of 2015, ito po yung Safe Spaces Act or yung Bawal Bastos Law.

3614
03:31:34,660 --> 03:31:36,700
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: At the moment, Madam Chair,

3615
03:31:37,040 --> 03:31:50,960
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: we have around, out of our 2,347 HEIs, and out of that, 561 po yung SUCs, including the campuses or external campuses,

3616
03:31:51,400 --> 03:32:02,240
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: we have monitored through our regional offices, the compliance to the Bawal Bastos Law or Safe Spaces Act Law.

3617
03:32:02,240 --> 03:32:04,920
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: Ito po'y embedded sa

3618
03:32:04,920 --> 03:32:11,340
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: kanilang student SAS monitoring and evaluation.

3619
03:32:11,340 --> 03:32:20,300
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: Kasi po dahil wala po talagang budget for specific monitoring and evaluation of GAD-related projects,

3620
03:32:20,540 --> 03:32:31,800
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: what we do is we incorporate the monitoring and evaluation in the programs po of our student affairs and services.

3621
03:32:32,240 --> 03:32:36,660
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: So Madam Chair and Congressman Elago,

3622
03:32:36,860 --> 03:32:51,400
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: we would just give our report as to the exact number of amount or budget that was given to the different regional offices

3623
03:32:51,400 --> 03:32:58,760
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: in relation to the monitoring and evaluation of our compliance to Safe Spaces Act.

3624
03:32:59,860 --> 03:33:02,640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, hindi lang po sa Safe Spaces Act.

3625
03:33:02,720 --> 03:33:06,260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kundi dun sa 1995 natin na Anti-Sexual Harassment Act.

3626
03:33:07,160 --> 03:33:11,320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nabanggit niyo ho yung tungkol sa mga public universities and colleges natin.

3627
03:33:11,320 --> 03:33:14,880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero paano naman sa mga pribadong pamantasan at kolehyo,

3628
03:33:14,900 --> 03:33:20,400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: natitiyak po ba natin na meron silang mga functional na Committee on Decorum and Investigation

3629
03:33:20,400 --> 03:33:30,580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa panahon na meron pong magsusumbong, may mag-uulat, may kaso na ihahain, ay merong tutugon sa kanila at tutulong sa antas

3630
03:33:30,580 --> 03:33:32,660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng kanilang paaralan.

3631
03:33:33,600 --> 03:33:40,140
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: Madam Chair, based po doon sa IRR ng aming CMO1 Series of 2015,

3632
03:33:41,220 --> 03:33:55,340
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: nakapaloob po doon na ang compliance sa batas through establishments of CODIS ay talaga pong tinatry po ng Commission to really get the figures.

3633
03:33:55,600 --> 03:34:00,040
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: So we will submit po our data.

3634
03:34:00,040 --> 03:34:08,480
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: Because at the moment we are asking for all HEIs, whether private or private, their actual compliance.

3635
03:34:08,480 --> 03:34:20,200
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: But let me just quote our recent survey that at the moment we have 66% na functional po yung CODI.

3636
03:34:20,200 --> 03:34:31,880
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: At kasama rin po rito yung pagkakandak nila ng mga informal investigations in relation to the anti-sexual harassment law.

3637
03:34:32,420 --> 03:34:38,520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay, so just to clarify, 66% functional CODI for public and private HEI for both?

3638
03:34:38,740 --> 03:34:39,420
CHED Regional Director IV Edna Imelda F. Legazpi: Yes, Madam Chair.

3639
03:34:39,420 --> 03:34:47,060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hingi na lang po natin yung detalye nito, kasama na yung report tungkol sa disposisyon ng SH and GBSH cases

3640
03:34:47,060 --> 03:34:57,220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para matiyak natin na yung lahat ng suporta para matiyak yung ligtas ng mga paaralan mula sa kahit anong tipo ng pambabastos at sekswal na pang-aabuso ay malinaw.

3641
03:34:57,220 --> 03:35:00,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Madam Chair, tungkol po sa Legal Education Board,

3642
03:35:01,000 --> 03:35:09,140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nakakabahala po na sunod-sunod na zero yung mahalagang programa mula sa Clinical Legal Education Program,

3643
03:35:09,440 --> 03:35:18,440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Legal Education Advancement Program, Legal Education Access and Developmental Scholarship, puro zero para sa taong 2027.

3644
03:35:18,440 --> 03:35:29,140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maaari ho bang matanong ang LEB kung ano yung mga mahalagang mandato at serbisyo na maaapektuhan at hindi natin magagawa

3645
03:35:29,140 --> 03:35:31,640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung walang pondo para sa 2027.

3646
03:35:31,640 --> 03:35:43,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mahalaga ito, Madam Chair, kasi sa panahon na walang functional CODI ang isang pamantasan, nanghihingi ho talaga ng tulong mula sa iba't ibang mga CSOs including LEB.

3647
03:35:43,380 --> 03:35:48,000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: I'm sure marami din po nare-refer sa inyo na cases na may kinalaman sa ganitong usapin.

3648
03:35:53,060 --> 03:35:59,780
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Madam Chair, may I request, thank you very much for that question, Representative Elago, please.

3649
03:35:59,780 --> 03:36:04,620
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Madam Chair, may I request the representative of LEB to please answer.

3650
03:36:05,420 --> 03:36:09,160
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes, as always, please introduce yourself and your position.

3651
03:36:09,740 --> 03:36:13,360
Legal Education Board Commissioner Justine Kyle D. Mapalo: Madam Chair, I am Commissioner Justine Kyle Mapalo from the Legal Education Board.

3652
03:36:15,840 --> 03:36:21,140
Legal Education Board Commissioner Justine Kyle D. Mapalo: The question of Honorable Rep. Elago, so primarily there are four projects, ma'am, in fact.

3653
03:36:21,320 --> 03:36:25,280
Legal Education Board Commissioner Justine Kyle D. Mapalo: So the first one is the Clinical Legal Education Program or the CLEP.

3654
03:36:25,620 --> 03:36:28,240
Legal Education Board Commissioner Justine Kyle D. Mapalo: So it's free legal aid for the marginalized.

3655
03:36:28,440 --> 03:36:32,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, can we ask our officer to move closer to the microphone?

3656
03:36:32,860 --> 03:36:33,860
Legal Education Board Commissioner Justine Kyle D. Mapalo: Yes, ma'am.

3657
03:36:33,960 --> 03:36:39,900
Legal Education Board Commissioner Justine Kyle D. Mapalo: So primarily, yung Clinical Legal Education Program or the CLEP, which offers free legal aid for the marginalized.

3658
03:36:40,520 --> 03:36:45,320
Legal Education Board Commissioner Justine Kyle D. Mapalo: So it's a referral system where law clinics grants and community access to justice.

3659
03:36:45,480 --> 03:36:53,220
Legal Education Board Commissioner Justine Kyle D. Mapalo: So, ma'am, primarily this is not just in fact to help the marginalized but also our law students to be able to practice, ma'am.

3660
03:36:53,600 --> 03:36:59,080
Legal Education Board Commissioner Justine Kyle D. Mapalo: And as you've mentioned, ma'am, sa NEP, it was allotted zero pesos, ma'am.

3661
03:37:00,540 --> 03:37:04,500
Legal Education Board Commissioner Justine Kyle D. Mapalo: So, then next is, ma'am, the Legal Education Advancement Program, or the LEAP,

3662
03:37:04,500 --> 03:37:10,620
Legal Education Board Commissioner Justine Kyle D. Mapalo: which focuses primarily on faculty development, quality assurance, research, and institutional modernization,

3663
03:37:10,620 --> 03:37:14,380
Legal Education Board Commissioner Justine Kyle D. Mapalo: which as well got zero pesos in the NEP.

3664
03:37:15,160 --> 03:37:19,040
Legal Education Board Commissioner Justine Kyle D. Mapalo: And the Legal Education Access Development Scholarship or the LEADS,

3665
03:37:19,040 --> 03:37:25,620
Legal Education Board Commissioner Justine Kyle D. Mapalo: which pertains to student scholarships, graduate faculty, development research, and international fellowships,

3666
03:37:25,620 --> 03:37:28,940
Legal Education Board Commissioner Justine Kyle D. Mapalo: which as well got zero pesos ngayon po.

3667
03:37:29,700 --> 03:37:31,140
Legal Education Board Commissioner Justine Kyle D. Mapalo: Yung tatlong yun lang po.

3668
03:37:32,220 --> 03:37:37,920
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Madam Chair, Madam Chair, Madam Chair, Madam Chair,

3669
03:37:38,060 --> 03:37:42,340
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Madam Chair, may I support pa?

3670
03:37:42,540 --> 03:37:53,540
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Madam Rep. Elago, ang total request po ng LEB is 216.7 million.

3671
03:37:54,580 --> 03:37:59,420
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Ang ibinigay po ay 69.1 million.

3672
03:37:59,420 --> 03:38:03,240
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And under this pa, 216 million,

3673
03:38:03,700 --> 03:38:07,040
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Meron silang CLEP, 57 million.

3674
03:38:07,740 --> 03:38:09,580
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: LEADS, 83 million.

3675
03:38:10,340 --> 03:38:11,840
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: LEAP, 24 million.

3676
03:38:12,380 --> 03:38:17,560
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And LERP augmentation, 51 million, honorable representative.

3677
03:38:20,620 --> 03:38:22,000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Zero ang mga ito.

3678
03:38:22,000 --> 03:38:25,200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, yes. So wala ho. Walang pondo ang mga ito.

3679
03:38:25,220 --> 03:38:29,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya, Madam Chair, this is not just a request or a simple call,

3680
03:38:29,520 --> 03:38:35,680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: but really a demand for the restoration of the funding for these particular programs.

3681
03:38:35,880 --> 03:38:41,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: As I've stated, hindi lang po sana sa level ng 2026 GAA.

3682
03:38:42,020 --> 03:38:45,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi alam ko maliit din yung nakuha from the 2026 GAA.

3683
03:38:45,640 --> 03:38:52,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero yung mas malapit naman sa pangangailangan nila para matiyak natin yung mas marami, mas malawak,

3684
03:38:52,760 --> 03:38:56,180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mas abot kamay na tulong sa legal.

3685
03:38:56,460 --> 03:38:59,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi lang po ito sa legal assistance kundi sa pangkabuuan,

3686
03:38:59,940 --> 03:39:03,580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagpapalakas dun ng sistemang legal sa ating bansa.

3687
03:39:03,580 --> 03:39:08,280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At pag titiyak na ito ay tunay na nagsisilbi dun sa ating mga nangangailangan.

3688
03:39:08,660 --> 03:39:13,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Madam Chair, gusto ko rin pong magtanong tungkol sa student loan program.

3689
03:39:13,540 --> 03:39:16,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi part din po ito ng UAQTE.

3690
03:39:17,860 --> 03:39:21,400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit hindi ko po siya nakita ngayon sa presentation ng CHED.

3691
03:39:21,400 --> 03:39:25,820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Though tinatanong ko lang ho, kahit hindi po kami talaga sumusuporta dito,

3692
03:39:25,820 --> 03:39:34,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa pinakahuling ulat dati ng CHED, sinabi nila na 2% lang ng overall na nag-a-avail ng SLP yung nakaka-graduate.

3693
03:39:34,880 --> 03:39:42,660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At marami sa nag-enroll through SLP ay hindi rin naman nakakatapos at hindi rin naman nakakabayad.

3694
03:39:42,680 --> 03:39:47,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kumbaga nawawaldas at nasasayang lang din po yung pondo na nilalagay dito.

3695
03:39:47,580 --> 03:39:51,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So just to clarify, for 2027 wala po tayong pondo for SLP?

3696
03:39:58,260 --> 03:40:01,940
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Thank you very much for that question and reminder po.

3697
03:40:03,020 --> 03:40:10,560
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: 2026 hindi rin kami nag-propose. Kahit 2027 hindi kami nag-propose.

3698
03:40:10,560 --> 03:40:14,200
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Because there are concerns that we need to settle on the ground.

3699
03:40:14,620 --> 03:40:19,040
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: We already started meeting with the designated bank.

3700
03:40:19,200 --> 03:40:22,820
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: We implemented this study now, pay later amount.

3701
03:40:22,820 --> 03:40:26,760
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And there are amount that needs to be revisited.

3702
03:40:26,760 --> 03:40:31,160
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And now we are finalizing the guidelines, honorable congresswoman.

3703
03:40:31,960 --> 03:40:35,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, maraming salamat. Sana hindi lang ito for 2026 and 2027.

3704
03:40:36,100 --> 03:40:40,340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa tingin ko, tanggalin na talaga natin yung pautang pagdating dito sa mga subsidies.

3705
03:40:40,640 --> 03:40:48,560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi clearly, malaki po yung pangangailangan para dun sa direct financial subsidies assistance sa ating mga estudyante.

3706
03:40:48,560 --> 03:40:57,440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya kasama din pong representasyon na ito sa pagtitiyak na mas mataas yung pondo para sa ating mga student financial assistance program.

3707
03:40:57,820 --> 03:41:00,100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bukod po dyan, pati sa mga teachers.

3708
03:41:00,100 --> 03:41:02,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para sa kanilang continuing professional development.

3709
03:41:03,180 --> 03:41:06,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Malaki din pong pangangailangan para taasan ang pondo dyan.

3710
03:41:06,840 --> 03:41:13,740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At tiyakin na diretsyo ho yung mga scholarships natin sa mga beneficiaries.

3711
03:41:13,740 --> 03:41:20,340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At hindi po ito magamit sa kung anuman po na mga kwestyonable na mga proseso.

3712
03:41:20,340 --> 03:41:21,060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat.

3713
03:41:22,400 --> 03:41:23,520
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Madam Chair.

3714
03:41:23,860 --> 03:41:30,140
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: para po lang matugunan po yung concern ng ating good congresswoman,

3715
03:41:30,140 --> 03:41:40,580
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yung sa scholarship po na kasali doon ang faculty development amounting to 697 million kasama po sa hindi na ibigay.

3716
03:41:41,480 --> 03:41:50,000
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Sa monitoring and evaluation na nandun ang monitoring ng safe spaces, 258 million hindi na ibigay.

3717
03:41:50,000 --> 03:42:00,180
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So marami pong salamat sa word of support na sana po if this will be given, ay ma-implement namin ang mga nailatag na namin na programa

3718
03:42:00,180 --> 03:42:02,980
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: At mapalakas ang aming pagmomonitor.

3719
03:42:03,440 --> 03:42:04,720
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Thank you Madam Chair.

3720
03:42:04,900 --> 03:42:08,560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: We reiterate our call for the restoration of the said budget cuts.

3721
03:42:08,740 --> 03:42:13,640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Particularly on the budget for safe spaces, faculty development, and scholarship programs.

3722
03:42:13,960 --> 03:42:15,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat Madam Chair. Maraming salamat.

3723
03:42:15,860 --> 03:42:17,020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Thank you po.

3724
03:42:18,290 --> 03:42:20,470
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes, thank you, the Honorable Elago.

3725
03:42:21,410 --> 03:42:25,670
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: And now, we move to the majority.

3726
03:42:26,230 --> 03:42:29,470
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: And the Chair recognizes the Honorable Representative

3727
03:42:29,470 --> 03:42:32,490
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Julius Cesar Vergara.

3728
03:42:33,610 --> 03:42:35,370
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Thank you, Madam Chair.

3729
03:42:37,590 --> 03:42:39,150
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Magandang tanghali po.

3730
03:42:39,950 --> 03:42:46,190
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Noong nakaraan po ay nagkaroon po ako ng honor na makilala si Commissioner Mirna.

3731
03:42:46,670 --> 03:43:02,290
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: At naipakita ko po sa kanya yung bill noong aking dating Congresswoman Rhea Vergara hinggil po sa violence.

3732
03:43:05,570 --> 03:43:06,970
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ang totoo noon,

3733
03:43:07,090 --> 03:43:08,590
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: sikat po yung Tacloban,

3734
03:43:08,710 --> 03:43:09,810
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: sikat yung Ateneo,

3735
03:43:10,670 --> 03:43:14,490
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: ngunit sa amin rin po,

3736
03:43:14,570 --> 03:43:16,170
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: sa distrito namin,

3737
03:43:16,370 --> 03:43:20,050
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: ay Santa Rosa, Nueva Ecija,

3738
03:43:20,190 --> 03:43:23,210
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: ay nagkaroon rin po ng barilan.

3739
03:43:23,210 --> 03:43:23,650
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So,

3740
03:43:23,650 --> 03:43:30,230
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: para ho hindi ko makuha 'yung limang minuto,

3741
03:43:30,230 --> 03:43:39,590
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: hindi ko na ipapakitang muli yung naipakita ko na salita ng aking asawa noong 2017

3742
03:43:39,600 --> 03:43:41,170
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: hinggil sa violence.

3743
03:43:42,150 --> 03:43:42,680
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ano ho?

3744
03:43:43,150 --> 03:43:50,410
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: In essence, it says, yung internet is addictive.

3745
03:43:52,050 --> 03:43:55,430
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Addictive and merong mabuti,

3746
03:43:55,440 --> 03:43:58,350
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: merong masama.

3747
03:43:58,350 --> 03:44:13,730
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: At doon sa mabuti, sometimes merong yung sama, it will outweigh the good.

3748
03:44:14,950 --> 03:44:19,490
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So ngayon, yung Singapore, may mga batas na.

3749
03:44:20,310 --> 03:44:23,130
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Yung New Zealand ay nag-aayos na ng batas.

3750
03:44:23,130 --> 03:44:29,870
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Siyam na taon na po naming ina-advocate itong bagay na 'to.

3751
03:44:30,830 --> 03:44:44,230
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So, sa atin po, sa mga SUC natin, na ang kagandahan po ninyo ay maganda ang utilization po ninyo.

3752
03:44:45,210 --> 03:44:52,890
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Kaya, binabasa ko po yung inyong proposed budget.

3753
03:44:52,890 --> 03:44:59,890
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: And alam ko po na si Madam Chair ay magiging generous sa inyo.

3754
03:45:00,010 --> 03:45:19,370
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Dahil nakikita ko po yung dati, pagkatapos yung Senado, after the BICAM, tumaas yung inyong pondo.

3755
03:45:19,370 --> 03:45:30,230
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: At ako po ay magtatanong lang kung yung utilization, alam ko na po na maganda, maayos.

3756
03:45:30,750 --> 03:45:39,370
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ang tanong ko lamang po ay paano nating pangangalagaan mabuti yung ating kabataan.

3757
03:45:40,990 --> 03:45:47,530
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Pagdating ho sa internet.

3758
03:45:56,430 --> 03:46:02,290
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yes po. Marami pong salamat sa tanong, Honorable Congressman.

3759
03:46:02,910 --> 03:46:08,630
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Ang CHED ay isa rin ito sa aming priority program.

3760
03:46:08,630 --> 03:46:21,250
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: But as I have said, before we can come up with or strengthen an existing policy and come up with a new program, we really know what is happening in the ground.

3761
03:46:21,250 --> 03:46:28,050
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So we really conducted a CHED student survey safety analytical portal.

3762
03:46:28,470 --> 03:46:42,990
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So any student across these 5.8 million students are free to visit our website at ilalagay nila yung mga complaints nila.

3763
03:46:42,990 --> 03:47:07,350
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And one of the five top incidents na nakuha namin is bullying, intimidation, and hazing, person-directed violence and threat, digital and online threats, property-related incidents, transport and community safety, dormitory and boarding house safety.

3764
03:47:07,350 --> 03:47:20,250
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Ito po yung data namin ngayon, but we also identified the best practices and those concerns that are not addressed.

3765
03:47:20,410 --> 03:47:28,630
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yun po yung basis namin sa pag-come up ng pag-strengthen ng existing policy or new policy po.

3766
03:47:28,630 --> 03:47:34,890
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Madami po kaming na-identify ding good practices nila, tulad ng security.

3767
03:47:35,230 --> 03:47:39,270
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: There is a security personnel assigned now sa mga buildings.

3768
03:47:39,910 --> 03:47:44,950
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Functional guard post, controlled entry-exit, nako-control na po.

3769
03:47:45,170 --> 03:47:49,270
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: The ID and visitor registration are strictly implemented.

3770
03:47:49,950 --> 03:47:53,190
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Adequate surrounding lighting, ini-encourage namin.

3771
03:47:53,310 --> 03:47:57,110
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: In fact, we have a proposal to have a net zero campus

3772
03:47:57,110 --> 03:48:00,910
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: para po hindi all through the night may light.

3773
03:48:01,250 --> 03:48:04,030
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Emergency alarm public address system.

3774
03:48:05,450 --> 03:48:07,110
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: 24-hour security deployment.

3775
03:48:07,470 --> 03:48:08,350
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Functional CCTV.

3776
03:48:09,070 --> 03:48:14,970
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Itong functional CCTV po, lahat ng mga SUCs are required to have this.

3777
03:48:14,970 --> 03:48:19,250
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: But part of their budget na inilalagay nila ngayon,

3778
03:48:19,250 --> 03:48:20,770
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: and then vehicle gate control.

3779
03:48:21,110 --> 03:48:23,450
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So lahat po ito mino-monitor namin,

3780
03:48:23,590 --> 03:48:27,990
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: yung mga possible windows where we can

3781
03:48:27,990 --> 03:48:30,650
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: minimize external intrusion to the

3782
03:48:30,650 --> 03:48:34,030
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: campus. On top of this, we are revisiting

3783
03:48:34,030 --> 03:48:35,630
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: the safety spaces guidelines.

3784
03:48:39,250 --> 03:48:40,730
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Maraming salamat po.

3785
03:48:40,730 --> 03:48:43,650
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: At yun lamang po ang akin.

3786
03:48:43,650 --> 03:48:50,630
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: At sinasabi ko lamang po na naniniwala po ako sa institusyon ninyo

3787
03:48:50,630 --> 03:48:54,310
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: at gustong-gusto ko po na sana ay

3788
03:48:55,410 --> 03:48:58,720
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: mabigyan pa ho kayo ng mas malaking

3789
03:48:58,720 --> 03:49:01,710
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: budget. Maraming salamat po.

3790
03:49:09,350 --> 03:49:11,910
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Palagi daw kayong present sa board meeting ko.

