03:49:26,500 --> 03:49:29,420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And of course, good afternoon to Ched.

3796
03:49:29,980 --> 03:49:36,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And syempre, nandito sa lahat ang mga attached agencies in charge sa knowledge production,

3797
03:49:36,660 --> 03:49:40,920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: scientific progress na nasa heart dyan, kabataan.

3798
03:49:40,920 --> 03:49:43,540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at siyempre yung educational sectors.

3799
03:49:44,640 --> 03:49:48,780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Siguro gusto ko pong mag-take off sa discussion last year.

3800
03:49:49,340 --> 03:49:58,120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Last year, yung kinampanya talaga natin ay yung ma-resolve yung free higher education deficiency.

3801
03:49:58,860 --> 03:50:05,620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Siguro update lang po, according to DBM at least, meron pong 9 billion na na-release.

3802
03:50:05,620 --> 03:50:16,760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And so, may pending pong iilan pa para po ma-ensure na hindi... or mapunan na yung deserve ng ating mga SUCs.

3803
03:50:17,220 --> 03:50:21,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero dahil sa anomalya sa calculation sa budget ay nagkulang.

3804
03:50:22,560 --> 03:50:28,540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero ang 12 billion, at ito po yung ni-note din natin last time, hindi po ito yung kabuoang deficiencies pa.

3805
03:50:28,620 --> 03:50:30,220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But it is only up to 2025.

3806
03:50:30,220 --> 03:50:35,580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, meron pong inasahan tayo na 2026 or even

3807
03:50:36,040 --> 03:50:38,120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Up to AY 2026, 2027.

3808
03:50:38,900 --> 03:50:43,620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And nung tinanong natin yung DBM, may bagong calculation sila.

3809
03:50:43,800 --> 03:50:48,680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, as to wala or even at least minimize yung deficiency.

3810
03:50:49,220 --> 03:50:57,300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Siguro ang tanong ko po, yung dahil na-resolve na po, meron po bang monitoring ang CHED

3811
03:50:57,300 --> 03:51:05,100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung may naranasan po bang mga FHE deficiency, ang mga SUCs beyond the 12 billion.

3812
03:51:05,620 --> 03:51:07,000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2025 to 2027.

3813
03:51:07,380 --> 03:51:07,840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Chair.

3814
03:51:08,260 --> 03:51:13,700
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yeah, thank you very much for that question and concern, Kong.

3815
03:51:13,700 --> 03:51:19,700
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So far, the deficiency for the free higher education from 2022 to 2025,

3816
03:51:20,760 --> 03:51:25,820
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: na pinagtulungan nating i-solve, ay medyo okay na po.

3817
03:51:25,920 --> 03:51:28,680
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Masaya na ang mga higher education.

3818
03:51:28,980 --> 03:51:33,960
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: As to the question na meron bang discrepancy, as far as I know, wala naman.

3819
03:51:34,160 --> 03:51:35,600
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Because before we finance,

3820
03:51:35,620 --> 03:51:41,460
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: yung pag-finalize, yung pag-finalize nyo, kung pagbigay ng allotment,

3821
03:51:41,980 --> 03:51:49,460
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: ay na-validate many times between the PASUC representatives and DBM.

3822
03:51:49,720 --> 03:51:55,200
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So, we came to an agreement that this is the number, now this is the amount that we need to pay.

3823
03:51:56,900 --> 03:52:03,140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And then we heard that meron na pong updated calculation para makuha yung budget.

3824
03:52:03,140 --> 03:52:04,140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, itong...

3825
03:52:05,620 --> 03:52:08,300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Formula na ito, may kopya po ba yung CHED?

3826
03:52:09,040 --> 03:52:12,500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And maaari po bang maisumiti sa representasyong ito?

3827
03:52:13,000 --> 03:52:18,560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And is this right now sufficient para makuha yung budget na kailangan?

3828
03:52:19,350 --> 03:52:19,700
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yes

3829
03:52:19,700 --> 03:52:21,040
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: po.

3830
03:52:21,400 --> 03:52:26,620
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: For the formula of the release of the free higher education,

3831
03:52:27,340 --> 03:52:31,140
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: deficiency of free higher education in the past four years,

3832
03:52:31,140 --> 03:52:35,180
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: we have released publicly yung joint memorandum circular.

3833
03:52:35,620 --> 03:52:37,620
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Between CHED and DBM.

3834
03:52:38,000 --> 03:52:39,080
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Nandun po yun.

3835
03:52:39,540 --> 03:52:45,660
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: But for the 2025, ay...

3836
03:52:45,660 --> 03:52:48,340
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: 2025, 2026, na meron na naman.

3837
03:52:48,980 --> 03:52:51,120
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: It is another brewing deficiency.

3838
03:52:51,900 --> 03:52:53,940
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Pero na, natinitingnan namin.

3839
03:52:54,540 --> 03:52:58,080
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So, as to the calculation, we came to an agreement

3840
03:52:58,080 --> 03:53:02,620
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: na before 1 is to 25 yung faculty-student ratio.

3841
03:53:02,620 --> 03:53:04,980
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Pero, it is so unrealistic.

3842
03:53:04,980 --> 03:53:07,980
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: The lower, mas maraming nababayaran.

3843
03:53:08,720 --> 03:53:13,040
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Pero, sa totoo lang naman, okay naman yung 1 is to 40.

3844
03:53:13,640 --> 03:53:15,280
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So, yun yung basis namin.

3845
03:53:15,420 --> 03:53:18,940
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Kasi, it's very unrealistic to impose on 1 is to 25.

3846
03:53:19,160 --> 03:53:21,280
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Eh, lalong maraming hindi mababayaran.

3847
03:53:21,880 --> 03:53:24,740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So, we are agreeing now with PASUC and DBM

3848
03:53:24,740 --> 03:53:29,860
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: na we will use the 1 is to 40 student-faculty ratio.

3849
03:53:29,860 --> 03:53:30,400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Okay.

3850
03:53:30,860 --> 03:53:34,780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kung maaari po makapagsubmit din po ng documentation on that,

3851
03:53:34,980 --> 03:53:37,020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to the committee, through the committee,

3852
03:53:37,560 --> 03:53:40,300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yun din po yung na-foresee natin last year, no,

3853
03:53:40,440 --> 03:53:42,480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na magkakaroon ng ganong deficiency.

3854
03:53:42,720 --> 03:53:45,540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero, kung kaya naman pong aksyonan sa pinakakagyat

