4626
04:26:01,460 --> 04:26:05,060
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: We proposed for 70.2 billion kong.

4627
04:26:05,580 --> 04:26:10,620
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And the data, the basis was never a magic based on data.

4628
04:26:11,580 --> 04:26:13,840
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: We got 35 billion for NEP.

4629
04:26:14,460 --> 04:26:16,620
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: The gap is 34 billion.

4630
04:26:16,940 --> 04:26:23,000
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: In my presentation na kanina, we identified the big ticket na maasasagasaan.

4631
04:26:23,000 --> 04:26:25,920
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: UAQTEA, 29 billion ang kulang.

4632
04:26:26,500 --> 04:26:29,300
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Scholarship, 697 million.

4633
04:26:29,800 --> 04:26:34,340
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yung digital transformation natin namin, sana po ibigay.

4634
04:26:34,380 --> 04:26:37,520
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Masayang yung aming digital system na na-develop.

4635
04:26:37,740 --> 04:26:38,960
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: 331.

4636
04:26:39,800 --> 04:26:43,300
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: 258 million sa monitoring and evaluation function.

4637
04:26:43,700 --> 04:26:46,540
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And the others include many things.

4638
04:26:46,780 --> 04:26:50,860
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So ang total po is 34.8 billion ang kulang.

4639
04:26:50,860 --> 04:26:53,640
Rep. Brian Poe: Madam Chair, did I hear that right?

4640
04:26:54,060 --> 04:26:57,160
Rep. Brian Poe: 97 million was lost from scholarships?

