Rep. Brian Poe: And I haven't noticed.

4685
04:29:54,460 --> 04:29:57,940
Rep. Brian Poe: There seems to be no budget for research and development.

4686
04:29:58,280 --> 04:29:58,720
Rep. Brian Poe: No.

4687
04:29:58,860 --> 04:29:59,500
Rep. Brian Poe: And.

4688
